  "description": "For some reason, her boyfriend, Eom Jae-Yeong, hasn’t aged a day since he turned 19. Kim Ra-Bin, who has been dating him for 14 years, sets out to uncover the truth he’s been trying to hide. A missing SSD and recurring dreams. As she pieces together the puzzle, the reality she’s always believed in begins to crumble.\n\n(Source: Naver, translated)",
